ENTRY            K2315   20260831   20260908   20260908       K025
SUBENT        K2315001   20260831   20260908   20260908       K025
BIB                 12         23
TITLE      Emission of photoneutrons from 29Si at photon energies
           up to 13 MeV
AUTHOR     (K.Fukuda, S.Okabe)
INSTITUTE  (2JPNOSP)
REFERENCE  (J,JPJ,34,315,1973)
PART-DET   (N)
INC-SOURCE (BRST)
SAMPLE     - Chemical-form of target is element. SiO2
           - Physical-form of target is solid.
           - Target-thickness: 0.89 g
           - Backing is aluminium. capsule of 1 cm diameter and 1
             cm long
           (14-SI-29,ENR=0.92)
FACILITY   (LINAC,2JPNOSP)
ANALYSIS   (PLA) 0.5 MeV bin width
DETECTOR   - Efficiency: The efficiency was flat to within 10 %
             over the range of slow neutron energy up to 5 MeV.
           - thermal neutron detector
ADD-RES    (COMP) Direct interaction model
HISTORY    (20110622C) M.Odsuren
           (20260713A) MA: deleted COMMON/ANG and EN-SEC in 001;
                       modified REFERENCE, FACILITY in 001,
                       STATUS in 002-003.
ENDBIB              23
COMMON               1          3
EN-RSL
PER-CENT
 1.
ENDCOMMON            3
ENDSUBENT           30
